{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41801","headline":"宿庐山白云峰重道者院 · 李中","name":"宿庐山白云峰重道者院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝顶松堂喜暂游，一宵玄论接浮丘。\n云开碧落星河近，月出沧溟世界秋。\n尘里年光何急急，梦中强弱自悠悠。\n他时书劒酬恩了，愿逐鸾车看十洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}